{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice is a story-driven, strategy roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coon, an average recent graduate, was granted the &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; skill during a job interview, which landed him a position as an Associate Producer at his dream game company. However, an unknown crisis awaits him in the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unleash the power of Rock-Paper-Scissors and take them down!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use turn-based &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; to defeat your opponents! Unreliable coworkers, teammates who dump their mess on others, annoying supervisors, bosses who gaslight and belittle\u2026 None of these sit right with me\u2014I\u2019m shutting them down, no questions asked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If I could hit restart, would the ending turn out different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layoffs, project shutdowns, company collapse, and even \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2014can I rewrite my fate with a second chance? Can I stop being that jittery rookie designer everyone walks all over?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No matter how many tries it takes, I\u2019ll find you again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This doesn\u2019t feel like a normal workplace\u2026 And they aren\u2019t just random colleagues I crossed paths with\u2014they\u2019re \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587. Can Coon, your average college grad, break free from this \u201cworkplace\u201d that\u2019s really just a twisted game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access Version includes 1/5 of the full version\u2019s content, with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 7 story chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 10+ characters, each with multiple expressive character sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 30+ event illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 50+ CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is slated for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Early Access players get a discounted price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 A free update to the full version will be available once it launches.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021230?t=1759055845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/44a3cf0443b24088e1a569496286a0c27ff3468f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759055845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/3d164219680c21217552c996d037f5f516e4fd80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759055845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/3d164219680c21217552c996d037f5f516e4fd80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759055845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Pawffice Early Access Is Live Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Luck Grunt Shakes Up the Workplace! Pawffice Early Access Is Live Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice tells the story of Coon, an average new grad, as he navigates the workplace\u2019s highs and lows\u2014even weirdly magical (?) mishaps\u2014and levels up in his growth step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access Version packs in roughly 1/5 of the full game\u2019s content, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 7 story chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 10+ characters with multiple expressive sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 30+ event art pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 50+ CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice is brought to you by a small team with 3 core members. With limited production capacity, we\u2019re pushing hard to launch the full version in February 2026. Once the full game drops, it\u2019ll revert to its original price. If you\u2019ve already bought the Early Access Version, you\u2019ll get a free update to the full version\u2014no repurchase needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot any bugs? Leave feedback on our Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) account: \u98de\u5929\u6d77\u725b\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4. Thanks for playing and for your precious input!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice is a story-driven, strategy roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coon, an average recent graduate, was granted the &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; skill during a job interview, which landed him a position as an Associate Producer at his dream game company. However, an unknown crisis awaits him in the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unleash the power of Rock-Paper-Scissors and take them down!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use turn-based &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; to defeat your opponents! Unreliable coworkers, teammates who dump their mess on others, annoying supervisors, bosses who gaslight and belittle\u2026 None of these sit right with me\u2014I\u2019m shutting them down, no questions asked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If I could hit restart, would the ending turn out different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layoffs, project shutdowns, company collapse, and even \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2014can I rewrite my fate with a second chance? Can I stop being that jittery rookie designer everyone walks all over?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.poster.avif?t=1759055845\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.webm?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.mp4?t=1759055845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No matter how many tries it takes, I\u2019ll find you again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This doesn\u2019t fee